# Cameos (T-122): the villager paired with someone comments on that person's big scene the next time the player talks to them. Compiled to zz_fs_cameo_reactions.json.

reaction cameo.juno.bram8
on event:bram_heart8
npcs juno
ttl 5
if hearts:juno>=3
once
plays cameo.juno.bram8.d
say cameo.juno.bram8.d juno: Bram talked to you! Properly! With words! He hummed at me once and I labeled it 'Event (Rare)'!

reaction cameo.bram.juno8
on event:juno_heart8
npcs bram
ttl 5
if hearts:bram>=3
once
plays cameo.bram.juno8.d
say cameo.bram.juno8.d bram: Hm. She told you about the forge. Hm. She's ready. Don't tell her I said.

reaction cameo.ione.hazel8
on event:hazel_heart8
npcs ione
ttl 5
if hearts:ione>=3
once
plays cameo.ione.hazel8.d
say cameo.ione.hazel8.d ione: Hazel was smiling at the returns desk this morning. I think you had something to do with it. Thank you.

reaction cameo.hazel.ione8
on event:ione_heart8
npcs hazel
ttl 5
if hearts:hazel>=3
once
plays cameo.hazel.ione8.d
say cameo.hazel.ione8.d hazel: (Ione was quiet this morning. A good quiet.) You talked with her. (Thank you. I noticed.)

reaction cameo.piper.wren8
on event:wren_heart8
npcs piper
ttl 5
if hearts:piper>=3
once
plays cameo.piper.wren8.d
say cameo.piper.wren8.d piper: Wren told you the bag thing! She never tells anyone! I knew about the bag! I wrote a song about the bag! She hates it!

reaction cameo.wren.piper8
on event:piper_heart8
npcs wren
ttl 5
if hearts:wren>=3
once
plays cameo.wren.piper8.d
say cameo.wren.piper8.d wren: My darling Piper played you the new one, didn't she? I heard the bridge from the cellar. I wept into a pickle.

reaction cameo.felix.tilda8
on event:tilda_heart8
npcs felix
ttl 5
if hearts:felix>=3
once
plays cameo.felix.tilda8.d
say cameo.felix.tilda8.d felix: Tilda told you something, didn't she. She's never told me. Thirty years, and not a word. Hm. I respect it.

reaction cameo.tilda.felix8
on event:felix_heart8
npcs tilda
ttl 5
if hearts:tilda>=3
once
plays cameo.tilda.felix8.d
say cameo.tilda.felix8.d tilda: I hear Felix told you about the big one, dear. It's been this big for thirty years. It's a good fish.

reaction cameo.marcus.dorian8
on event:dorian_heart8
npcs marcus
ttl 5
if hearts:marcus>=3
once
plays cameo.marcus.dorian8.d
say cameo.marcus.dorian8.d marcus: Dorian said a whole sentence yesterday. About you. I built him a shelf. It seemed right.

reaction cameo.dorian.marcus8
on event:marcus_heart8
npcs dorian
ttl 5
if hearts:dorian>=3
once
plays cameo.dorian.marcus8.d
say cameo.dorian.marcus8.d dorian: ...Marcus finished the roof. He looked up at it a long time. ...I stood with him.

reaction cameo.odalys.elara8
on event:elara_heart8
npcs odalys
ttl 5
if hearts:odalys>=3
once
plays cameo.odalys.elara8.d
say cameo.odalys.elara8.d odalys: Elara has been unusually calm. I suspect you. It is a clinical improvement. Thank you.

reaction cameo.elara.odalys8
on event:odalys_heart8
npcs elara
ttl 5
if hearts:elara>=3
once
plays cameo.elara.odalys8.d
say cameo.elara.odalys8.d elara: Dr. Penn took a nap! A real one! With the lamp off! I heard you helped! I'm knitting you something!

reaction cameo.juno.piper4
on event:piper_heart4
npcs juno
ttl 5
if hearts:juno>=3
once
plays cameo.juno.piper4.d
say cameo.juno.piper4.d juno: Piper played you a song! I heard it through the wall! It was too loud! It was perfect! I labeled the wall 'Wall (Thin)'!

reaction cameo.piper.juno4
on event:juno_heart4
npcs piper
ttl 5
if hearts:piper>=3
once
plays cameo.piper.juno4.d
say cameo.piper.juno4.d piper: Juno showed you the label maker! She showed me first! I have eleven labels! One says 'Piper (Loud)'! It's accurate!
